    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3812\"><em data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3812\">(18th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3893\">You temporarily elevate your community into minor civic-deity mode for a scene.</p><p data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3912\">For the duration:</p><ul data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"4054\"><li data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3943\"><p data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3943\">Broad stabilization occurs.</p></li><li data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"3966\"><p data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3966\">Panic cannot spread.</p></li><li data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"4003\"><p data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"4003\">Cooperative actions are amplified.</p></li><li data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4054\"><p data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4054\">Protection and solidarity increase dramatically.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4056\" data-end=\"4115\">This is not a damage spike.<br data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4086\" />It is communal transcendence.</p><h3 data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4125\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"4126\" data-end=\"4173\">Significant Civic Charge expenditure (2+ dice).</p><h3 data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4192\">Clarification</h3><p data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4247\">The power flows from the community—not from you alone.</p><h3 data-start=\"4249\" data-end=\"4261\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4393\">Apotheosis risks Dependence.<br data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4293\" />If communities begin believing they require divine elevation to function, long-term autonomy erodes.</p><p data-start=\"4395\" data-end=\"4432\"><span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\">fvtt-Item-steward_-civic-apothe…</span></p>",
